    "releaseNotes": "What's new in 1.2:\n\nMenu:\n- Tools reorganized into 4 categories: Artboards, Prep and check, Export, Measure and scale.\n- Tool names now match the script names.\n- New: SQFT Callout.\n- Pictures in the tool windows now load from files (no Temp writes): smaller scripts, quicker window start.\n\nProduction Helper 1.0:\n- CutContour follows the manual workflow.\n- Pro version no longer overwrites the cut line of another element.\n\nStandardize PDFs 2.0:\n- The Lacey PNG zip is named just <PDF name>.zip.\n\nSQFT Callout 2.2:\n- The ball is a real arrowhead (needs SQFT_Arrow.aia); bigger default size.\n\nExport Production Files 3.3:\n- Warns before exporting when file paths are too long for Windows; errors say which step failed.\n\nPreflight Check 1.1:\n- New layout: Standard checks and Sign type checks are collapsible sections in one column; both start closed and show error / warning counts in the header. Thinner window. A coloured verdict banner (Not ready / Almost ready / Ready for production), header stripes coloured by status, problems listed first, hints next to each problem, clearer button names (Select item, Ignore, Open Helper). Unused Swatches and Named Colors show as clickable colour chips (pick one swatch to remove only that one); a big green check shows when a check has nothing to report.",
